{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29222","headline":"泛五云溪 · 许浑","name":"泛五云溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此溪何处路，遥问白髯翁。\n佛庙千岩里，人家一岛中。\n鱼倾荷叶露，蝉噪柳林风。\n急濑鸣车轴，微波漾钓筒。\n石苔萦棹绿，山果拂舟红。\n更就千村宿，溪桥与剡通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}